KalmCityNousar_Area1_Text_CooltrainerF::
	.string "Today, I’m going to keep battling, no\n"
	.string "matter what, until I beat every\l"
	.string "single tough TRAINER!$"

KalmCityNousar_Area1_Text_Man::
	.string "I’m the best out of all my friends.\n"
	.string "But here…\l"
	.string "I’ve been useless!$"

KalmCityNousar_Area1_Text_Rocker::
	.string "My grand ambition is to conquer\n"
	.string "the BATTLE TOWER.\p"
	.string "And if my dream comes true…\p"
	.string "I… I’m going to ask INY next door\n"
	.string "if she will be friends with me!$"

KalmCityNousar_Area1_Text_Camper::
	.string "It’s not as if just anyone can come\n"
	.string "here, you know?\p"
	.string "Only those TRAINERS who’ve been\n"
	.string "recognized as tough can find\l"
	.string "this city.\p"
	.string "That’s why many TRAINERS don’t even\n"
	.string "know about this place.$"

KalmCityNousar_Area1_Text_Beauty::
	.string "There used to be nothing here not all\n"
	.string "that long ago.\p"
	.string "But, now look at this place! Amazing!\n"
	.string "I’ll bring my sister out to see this.$"

KalmCityNousar_Area1_Text_FatMan::
	.string "Munch, munch…\p"
	.string "It looks like this square’s filled with\n"
	.string "tough people.\p"
	.string "Munch, munch…$"

KalmCityNousar_Area1_Text_Sign2::
	.string "TRAINER TOWER ENTRANCE\n"
	.string "Rise to the Challenge, TRAINERS!$"

KalmCityNousar_Area1_Text_Sign3::
	.string "KALM CITY NOUSAR$"
